{"title":"Sand Devil","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 37 Dust Devil that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (3.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: mireChance: .25</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/sirocco-core\">Sirocco Core</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>82</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>67</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=36\" title=\"Pick level 36\"><td><b>36</b></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Camp\">Thak Scout Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>82</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=38\" title=\"Pick level 38\"><td><b>38</b></td><td>176</td><td>25.4</td><td>1,900</td><td class=\"muted\">528 · 35.6 · 5,700</td><td>67</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dust-mote\" title=\"Dust Mote - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 11 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1c70ff443aaceb81445a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Mote</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 251 total, 64–187 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scoured-glass\" title=\"Scoured Glass - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 3 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e3e1e7ee6d4d7434412d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scoured Glass</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 33 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 30 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Camp\">Thak Scout Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2129, 733 <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Behemoth's%20Wallow\">Behemoth&#39;s Wallow</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sand-devil\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Dust Devil: <a href=\"#/monster/dust-devil\">Dust Devil</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sirocco\">Sirocco</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d197bb2687af7a8b0b16.webp\" alt=\"Sand Devil\"></div><h3>Sand Devil</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>37 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–38)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Dust Devil</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>corrode · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>168</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>24.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1850</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>132 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}